  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>One of the four additional ability boosts gained at 1st level. It follows the normal rules for ability boosts: it increases a score by 2, or by 1 if the score is already 18 or higher, and no two of the four may apply to the same score.</p><p><strong>In Foundry:</strong> choose the attribute when prompted. A score already at 18 gains nothing on the sheet, because an odd score has the same modifier as the even one below it and every later boost is a whole +2.</p>",
      "gm": ""
    },
